                                "sense_id": "5d0366f3-d22a-3380-92cd-151c5f46a944",
                                "text": "The massive usage of the same peptide blocks in microbial and human proteomes inficiates any causal relationship(s) between sharing of microbial amino acid motifs/structures and autoimmune reactions in humans."
